  "source": "https://gc.nh.gov/rsa/html/LXIII/654/654-15.htm",
  "statuteText": "654:15 Party Registration. –\n\nWhenever names are added to the checklist the supervisors shall register the party membership of the voter if he desires such membership registered. The party membership of each voter may be registered by writing in ink, printing, or rubber stamping after the name of such voter the first 3 letters of the name of the party with which he registers."
